1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,635
Put z equal to one: the n th roots of unity.

2
00:00:04,635 --> 00:00:11,158
They sit on the unit circle at the corners of a regular n sided polygon, with one corner at one.

3
00:00:11,158 --> 00:00:16,666
Their sum is always zero, because they balance perfectly around the centre.

4
00:00:16,666 --> 00:00:20,338
Their product is minus one to the n plus one.

